macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
macos/Pods/
# Not *.xcworkspace: that blanket rule also excluded macos/Runner.xcworkspace,
# which Flutter needs to recognise the project at all. Without it CI failed
# with "No macOS desktop project configured" while local builds worked, since
# the file exists on disk and is only missing from the repository. Only the
# per-user Xcode state is excluded.
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

